01:32:44.480 --> 01:32:48.359
Still be mine


01:32:51.040 --> 01:32:56.114
Just waking from sleeping


01:32:56.240 --> 01:33:00.950
I'll try to play it safe


01:33:01.520 --> 01:33:05.991
If you take my song


01:33:06.320 --> 01:33:11.155
